Data
----

* MaleCNS v1.0 connectome (FlyEM / HHMI Janelia, University of Cambridge,
  MRC LMB, Google Research). Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), as linked by
  https://male-cns.janelia.org/download/. Paper:
  https://doi.org/10.1016/j.cell.2026.08.015.
  Bundled derivatives: data/12781.swc and data/556329.swc (two DNge104
  skeletons, sha256 in data/manifest.json), the normalized inclusion report
  in data-provenance/malecns_v1/, and the neuron-count figures quoted in the
  documentation. The 1.1 GB source tables are downloaded by
  `python -m brainlab.download` and are not redistributed here.
  Full text: licenses/upstream/CC-BY-4.0.txt.

* Huang, Luo et al., "Dopamine-mediated interactions between short- and
  long-term memory dynamics", Nature 634, 1141–1149 (2024),
  https://doi.org/10.1038/s41586-024-07819-w (CC BY 4.0). The mushroom-body
  plasticity rule in circuit.py is adapted from this paper. No figures,
  supplementary workbooks or article text are bundled.

* FlyWire and MANC are cited by name in documentation and source comments.
